{
  "slug": "descope-skills",
  "name": "Descope Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Descope authentication skills: integration, Auth0/Okta/WorkOS/Stytch migration, Terraform, FGA authorization schemas, security review, and BYOS custom UI",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `auth-review` (Static security review for authentication and authorization vulnerabilities), `auth0-to-descope` (Use this skill whenever anyone asks about migrating from Auth0 to Descope — whether they're a developer doing…), `descope-auth` (Integrate Descope authentication into applications), `descope-byos-builder` (Use when building React \"Bring Your Own Screen\" (BYOS) custom UI on top of a Descope flow —…), `descope-fga-schema` (Author, edit, or apply a Descope FGA schema using the ReBAC/ABAC DSL), `descope-terraform` (Set up and manage Descope projects with Terraform), `okta-cis-to-descope` (Use this skill whenever anyone asks about migrating from Okta Customer Identity Service (CIS) to Descope — whether…), `stytch-to-descope` (Use this skill whenever anyone asks about migrating from Stytch to Descope — whether they're a developer doing…), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install descope-skills@claude-community` from `descope/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
